  "description": "LIDREX crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C87 H45 Eu3 F36 N9 O30 Tb1,3(C6 H14). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a branched tree with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.036-4.038 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.39-113.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C87H45Eu3F36N9O30Tb·3C6H14.",
